  "limitations": [
    "The earlier evidence incorrectly inferred nominal-target-not-mapped from the operation kind and status. This record supersedes that causal claim: the original failure is operation-result-ownership-unknown. The original run and its product identities are retained as history.",
    "The maintained fixture checks a current conservative rejection: repeated constructors exhaust the bounded ownership scan even for acyclic Copy-only records. This diagnostic correction does not alter that scan or accepted language semantics. A future scan fix must convert this reproducer to a positive regression and preserve diagnostic coverage with an appropriate negative case.",
    "WVIR has no expression source map. The declaration line identifies the containing function, not the failing expression. Module index is admitted source-set order. Identifier diagnostics are bounded to 1024 UTF-8 bytes.",
    "The maintained source test prepares analysis through existing authenticated admission using supplied native tools. It can be rerun from tracked source with suitable current tools; this evidence uses retained products, not an independent cold bootstrap. The original Package-Lock snapshots remain local ignored evidence.",
    "The successful maintained Minimum-Program baseline is 221 bytes and was produced with the earlier Emitter-Source-Names.exe. Its identity and baseline WVB hash are included. The original snapshot positive output is also compared byte-for-byte.",
    "The intermediate Exact-Rules product passed the original snapshots but failed the maintained fixture because declaration-order lookup reported Lockstate instead of Lockstep. Only the final Canonical-Diagnostics product is claimed here.",
    "Focused development evidence only. Broad language, callable, admission, bootstrap, runtime and qualification suites were not run: the changed contract is diagnostic propagation and source-name reporting, not their acceptance or execution rules. Generated artifact readers passed their 14-file check.",
    "Files above 4 MiB retain the hosted-provider exit 73 and empty diagnostic before emission. Truncated accepted-size inputs retain exit 1 and Invalid-analysis diagnostics. All rejected test cases preserve a pre-existing output sentinel.",
    "Peak working-set memory was not measured. Function inspection reports 1504 parameter/local slots against the unchanged 2048-slot limit. Compile and both host packaging share one finite 15-minute deadline."
  ],
